  "summary": "For 20 years, I've been helping businesses and individuals build websites and web applications that actually work — incredibly fast, clean, and built to last.\n \nThrough Solar Pixel, I've delivered 150+ websites and web-based software projects for clients ranging from small local businesses to larger organizations. My core stack includes PHP, Laravel, MySQL/MariaDB, JavaScript, React, React Native, Next.js, REST APIs, and Git, with full server management experience on Apache/Linux and AWS environments. I also work with WordPress for clients who need it.\n \nWhat I bring that sets me apart is two decades of real-world experience across the full stack — from database architecture and server management to front-end design and graphic design work. I've built it, designed it, hosted it, and maintained it. That means fewer handoffs, fewer headaches, and a single point of contact who understands your whole project.\n \nIf you're looking for a reliable, experienced developer who takes ownership of projects from start to finish, let's talk.\n \n📌 solarpixel.com",
